{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55605","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"只图闲适乐箪瓢，莫讶烟霞道路遥。\n龙穴定知潜碧海，鹏程终是望丹霄。\n拨云岩下来（《古今禅藻集》作「求」）泉脉，嚼草坡边辨药苗。\n门锁薜萝无客至，庵前时有白云朝。\n（按：《古今禅藻集》卷十一收以上二首。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}